  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760387,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 in 1 - My Vet Practice + My Pet Hotel 2: Nintendo DS\n\n**Experience the heartwarming world of animal care with this delightful double game for your Nintendo DS!**\n\nFirst, step into the role of a budding veterinarian in *My Vet Practice*. Build and expand your own veterinary clinic, diagnosing and treating a wide variety of adorable animals. From common colds to more complex conditions, your skills and dedication are crucial to their recovery. Advance your studies to unlock new species and specialized treatments, becoming the go-to vet in town!\n\nThen, transition to *My Pet Hotel 2*, where you’ll manage a luxurious haven for furry, feathered, and scaled guests. Cater to their every whim, providing top-notch care, stylish decorations, and engaging activities. Nurture playful baby animals, teach them tricks, and strive to create a world-class pet hotel experience. \n\nWith two unique and engaging gameplay styles, *2 in 1 - My Vet Practice + My Pet Hotel 2* offers hours of charming fun for animal lovers of all ages!"
    },
